    "and src/data/ce_encounters.h (gCeEncounters, gCeEncounterInfo). The website rewrites",
    "gCeEncounters; scripts and C code read it through ce_loadenc and CeEnc_* (src/ce/encounters.c).",
    "Append new encounters at the end: ids are part of the engine's settings (CE_ENC_<id>).",
    "kind: starter | gift | egg | static | event | roamer | tutorial | trade | trade-request.",
